<title>HONG KONG: Hana Bank sets US$100 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Hana Bank sets US$100 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Dresdner (South East Asia).</p>
<p> BORROWER   HANA BANK</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$100 MLN   COUPON     6ML+31.5  MATURITY DEC.2001</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	    ISS PRICE  PAR	 LAUNCHED 11.NOV.96</p>
<p> PUTS	 YR 3	   CALLS	YR 3	REPLIES  27.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING    LUXEMBOURG   REPAYMENT  BULLET    DENOMS   $500K</p>
<p> RATING     Baa1**	 SALE LMTS  STANDARD  TAX PROV --</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	    CRS DEF    YES	 FORCE MAJ NA</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  S. KOREA     GOV LAW    ENGLISH   PAY DATE --</p>
<p> MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   LEAD MANAGERS    US$7 MLN+   15.0 BP   ALL-IN  36.5</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MGRS     US$5-6 MLN  13.5 BP   ALL-IN  36.0</p>
<p>   CO-MANAGERS	US$2-4 MLN  12.0 BP   ALL-IN  35.5</p>
<p>ARRANGERS  CITICORP INTERNATIONAL (BOOKS), DKB ASIA, DRESDNER</p>
<p>		SOUTH EAST ASIA, BANCA NAZIONALE DE LAVORO</p>
<p>		SINGAPORE AND IBJ ASIA (BOOKS).</p>
<p> NOTES	**ISSUER RATING.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
